
### Get all actors
GET http://localhost:8080/actor

### Get actor by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/actor/1



### Create a new actor
POST http://localhost:8080/actor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "name": "Sara",
  "gender": "Female",
  "age": 24
}



### Update Sara
PUT http://localhost:8080/actor/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "name": "Sara",
  "gender": "Female",
  "age": 25
}



### Delete Sara
DELETE http://localhost:8080/actor/4